• Growth: Intel-driven Outcomes-Based selling motions (e.g. Paid Software, Services Sales, Industry Transformational Engagements, VBS – New monetization model selling motions)</description>
        <inlineHelpText>• Core: Ecosystem-led Transactional selling motions (e.g. Ecosystem-led end-customer engagement, Run-rate or Repeat silicon and accelerator business)
• Growth: Intel-driven Outcomes-Based selling motions (e.g. Paid Software, Services Sales, Industry Transformational Engagements, VBS – New monetization model selling motions)</inlineHelpText>
